        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUkqlmA7zBG_JLN7lPgJrUuMwhUrbg0X2dlLE2i5g-mulNwhBeX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I've ordered candles from Auralux several times now for several occasions, and they have always been fabulous. Candles smell amazing even when they are not lit. And make such a beautiful statement sitting on any table or place setting. Not to mention, they are soy, so I am not worried about any harmful chemicals. I will be ordering here time and time again.",
        "time": 1744596029,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Melanie Arguin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116158112840707756967/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJcHlyE4YnQScdbLbllBf2VNtnGUqE24YYzx3W1q2eTi-SiIw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "These candles are so beautiful and smell so nice. I bought a set as a gift for a house warming. Not only were the candles beautiful, but so was the packaging. Delivery was also very quick. I love the smell so much, I went back and ordered a candle for myself. I'm excited to see all the new creations!",
        "time": 1745526259,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shil Patel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109686917775642834884/reviews",
