        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Love all the different designs in their collection! They can really elevate any space and are such great gifts! I was gifted a candle from their Valentine's collection - it smells so good and can really fill a space!",
        "time": 1744771260,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
